OL,3,GNEWSARape-accused tells jury woman
OL,4,A'participated' and did not appear
OL,5,Adrugged
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man accused of raping a woman whose
OL,8,Fhusband posted online sex adverts about
OL,9,Fher has told a court she "participated"
OL,10,Fand he believed she consented.
OL,12,FPhilip Young has pleaded guilty to
OL,13,Fmultiple charges of drugging and
OL,14,Fsexually abusing his wife, Joanne
OL,15,FYoung, during a 13-year period at their
OL,16,Fhome in Swindon, Wiltshire.
OL,18,FFour men are on trial at Winchester
OL,19,FCrown Court accused of sexually abusing
OL,20,FJoanne, who has waived her right to
OL,21,Fanonymity.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
