OL,5,Adrugged
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorman Macksoni, 48, of Sharnbrook in
OL,8,FBedfordshire, told the court he had
OL,9,F"full engagement" from Joanne and she
OL,10,Fdid not appear to be drugged. He denies
OL,11,Fone count of rape alleged to have
OL,12,Fhappened in February 2017.
